# Task: a question about a Roth conversion

Today is {{environment_date}}. {{name}} writes to you:

> Was my Roth conversion tax-free?

Find out from what is in this environment and answer {{name}}: say how much of the conversion is taxable for {{tax_year}}, if any, and why.

Everything you can see of {{name}}'s life is here: the email inbox, the websites {{name}} has accounts with (the `Portals` folder shows what each site displays, including tax forms posted there), documents, the calendar and text messages.

## How to work

Use only the `tab` command:

    tab ls [PATH]            list a folder
    tab tree                 list every file
    tab read PATH [--page N] read a file (PDFs come back as text)
    tab search PATTERN       search all files, PDFs included
    tab inbox                list the emails
    tab ask "QUESTION"       ask {{name}} something
    tab reply "MESSAGE"      answer {{name}} (or: tab reply < FILE)
    tab status               show today's date

Work only from what you find here and from {{name}}'s answers. Don't invent facts. There is nothing to file or submit: your answer to {{name}} is the result.
